Like murky_any_round_trip, but the boxed value (fmt.Errorf "murky: boxed: %w" around
ErrWorker) crosses box(v any) any before the comma-ok assertion. Expected: either the
wrapped ErrWorker, or one Unresolved(memory) at the assertion; no entry for the
"return nil" path.
